        <activityName xml:lang="en">Uranium natural, at underground mine</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Uranium natural, at underground mine
The data on radioactive emission to air and water are from old references;
UUID: 208df472-c4d1-3a78-83c9-e7b191fb6616
The module includes: diesel used in generators for all mining uses; transport of the diesel fuel; radioactive and non-radioactive emissions to air and water; water use (mining water).
Location: &lt;null&gt;
Technology: Average conditions in early 1980s.
Time period: undefined
Production volume: na
Sampling: Literature 
Extrapolations: &lt;null&gt;
Uncertainty adjustments: &lt;null&gt;
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_208df472-c4d1-3a78-83c9-e7b191fb6616.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
